abstract: >-
  Speaker-labeled transcripts, word-level timings, captions and speaker lists
  for New York City Council hearings. BetaNYC produced the transcripts, speaker
  labels and exports; the hearing video and the Legistar documents included for
  reference are records of the New York City Council, not BetaNYC's work.
  First hearing: Committee of the Whole, "Oversight - Examining the Risks Posed
  by Artificial Intelligence," 2026-10-05 (Legistar event 22752). Code is MIT;
  data is CC BY 4.0. Council video and documents are public records.
